    "metadata": {
      "storyTimeAdvanceDays": 0,
      "designIntent": "CARD 052b — The Vote Against Yourself. The mandatory betrayal node the whole Record was built for, honored honestly: it is not a lock. Fires only as the confirmation beat of 052 RIGHT, and only for a player who still holds the transparency or independence pledge. The player who wants the controlled outcome can still get it by abstaining (hands clean, room wins anyway) at a Power cost, or by casting the vote and breaking the word outright. What is removed is the ability to reach the fully-controlled outcome AND keep the promise AND pay nothing — the exact combination the game refuses to sell. For a player holding neither promise this card never appears; 052 RIGHT is just a vote."
